      "message": "test(app): rotary_verify pins the seam-ring move count of #3496\n\nPR #3496 (#3168) closes each Auto/Zigzag rotary level with a seam ring.\nThe matching d12.4 bar now plans 2,110 moves, not 2,064 (d20 bar:\n7,648 -> 7,578). All safety asserts of the test still pass. The pinned\ncount was obsolete; the air-lap law that it guards did not change.\n\nFixes #3774\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
